## Why This Is Asked

Tests ability to translate CKNE scores into real-time resource allocation for a streaming, low-latency path like WebSocket routing. Focus on fairness, latency budgets, and operational testing.

## Key Concepts

- CKNE-to-quotas mapping (connections, buffers, priorities)
- Real-time reallocation cadence (minute granularity)
- Per-tenant isolation in a shared socket pool
- Observability and SLA guarantees

## Code Example

